  m_text: "Dive into an incredible adventure as a brave tiger exploring mysterious
    jungles! In this unique platformer, you\u2019ll need to leap from platform to
    platform, but it\u2019s not as easy as it seems\u2014each platform is guarded
    by a math equation. To jump, you must quickly solve the problem and input the
    correct answer. Got it wrong? The tiger falls and starts over!\n\nThe game tests
    your quick thinking, reflexes, and math skills. With each level, the challenges
    grow harder, and the platforms spread farther apart. Can you guide the tiger
    to the crystal peak of the jungle?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76709f643ab386c4c9385c51506a9690, type: 2}
